<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0382_R32R0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Ruins of Alph.\nLook, touch, don’t steal.\fTry the slidin’ stone panels!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0382_R32R0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You studyin’ the ruins?\nA scientist on the come-up.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0382_R32R0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s drawings on the panels.\nI tried movin’ ’em.\fNo clue what they are.</language>
	</row>
</body>
